    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="38287f3a-8ce5-594f-9ff5-9fb69f6a6f30" activityNameId="5a5a4193-77bf-54c5-8e5e-3841f38ba471" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Porous asphalt (PA) surface layer, 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Porous asphalt (PA) surface layer, 0% recycling, high temperature, at plant
Modern Swiss technologies for regional storage facilities, material extraction, and asphalt production. Based on survey data from 73 asphalt mixing plants. 
UUID: 36ffc067-413f-419b-ba79-f30f17f05102
This dataset covers the production of average porous asphalt (PA) surface layers in Switzerland, with 0% reclaimed asphalt. The process represents an average PA, derived from the mean material composition of PA 8 and PA 11 layers. It includes raw material extraction, transportation, and manufacturing processes.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Production of hot mix asphalt (porous asphalt PA), using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 351352456 t 
Sampling: Survey
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_36ffc067-413f-419b-ba79-f30f17f05102.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
